sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Bank or data holder
    participant P as Provider adapter
    participant W as Job worker
    participant S as Sync service
    participant C as Client app
    actor U as User

    W->>P: Fetch transactions after the stored cursor
    P->>B: Request shared accounts' transactions
    B-->>P: Pending and posted transactions
    P-->>W: Transactions and next cursor
    W->>S: Store provider records and cursor (one transaction, no journal)
    C->>S: GET /v1/bank-feeds/{connectionId}/proposals
    S-->>C: Open proposals (untrusted descriptions)
    C->>U: Pre-filled entry form
    U->>C: Review and save
    C->>C: Save journal and outbox command (one transaction)
    C->>S: POST /v1/sync/commands (journal.post)
    S-->>C: applied
    C->>S: POST .../proposals/{recordId}/decision (accepted, journalId)
    S-->>C: Proposal accepted
